  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your emotional and reflex responses fade, allowing you to shrug off distracting conditions.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Death sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain +1 spell point. You can spend a spell point as an immediate action to gain a +2 bonus to saving throws against bleed, death effects, disease, energy drain, exhaustion, fatigue, mind-affecting effects, paralysis, poison, sleep effects, and stunning for 1 round. For each necrosis feat you possess beyond this one, the bonus and duration increase by 1.</p>\n<p><strong>Four Necrosis Feats:</strong> When you use this feat, you also gain a new saving throw against one of the above effects currently affecting you (your choice).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/necrosis-feats#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
